-- ============================================================
-- Warrior (Protection): Safeguard, redesigned
-- ============================================================
-- TODO.md: "Safeguard (2, 7): Redesigned. Blocking an attack has a 5/10%
--           chance to grant you Safeguard, allowing you to use Victory Rush
--           and doubling its damage but reducing its healing by 50%.
--           (2 ranks)"
--
-- Stock Safeguard reduces damage taken by the TARGET OF YOUR INTERVENE.  On a
-- solo fork that is a talent about somebody else, on a 30 second cooldown, and
-- it was worth two points of a tier-7 slot to nobody.  The redesign points it
-- at the thing Protection actually does constantly -- blocking -- and pays out
-- in the currency Arms already built (Victorious / Victory Rush, 4.63).
--
-- Zero C++.  Three DBC facts carry the whole talent:
--
-- 1. VICTORY RUSH IS GATED ON AN AURA STATE, NOT ON A SPELL ID.  Victory Rush's
--    CasterAuraState is AURA_STATE_WARRIOR_VICTORY_RUSH, and
--    SpellInfo::GetAuraState (SpellInfo.cpp:1994-1996) returns that state for
--    ANY spell matching:
--
--        SpellFamilyName == SPELLFAMILY_WARRIOR && SpellFamilyFlags[1] & 0x00040000
--
--    So a brand new buff enables Victory Rush simply by carrying that flag.
--    200646 is cloned from Victorious (32216) precisely so the flag, the
--    family and the 20 second duration come along for free -- do NOT overwrite
--    SpellFamilyFlags1 (262144) on it.
--
-- 2. VICTORY RUSH'S DAMAGE RESPECTS SPELLMOD_DAMAGE.  Its damage is finished in
--    SpellEffects.cpp:360-362 as ApplyPct(damage, AttackPower), and
--    Unit::MeleeDamageBonusDone applies SPELLMOD_DAMAGE to the result
--    (Unit.cpp:10398-10400).  +100% therefore doubles it.
--
-- 3. THE HEAL IS EFFECT 2, SO SPELLMOD_EFFECT2 (MiscValue 12) REACHES IT.
--    Victory Rush gained SPELL_EFFECT_HEAL_PCT on its empty Effect2 in
--    woa_2026_08_07_02.sql.  Unit::ApplyEffectModifiers (Unit.cpp:11612-11629)
--    maps effect index 1 to SPELLMOD_EFFECT2, so -50% halves the heal and
--    nothing else.
--
-- Both modifier effects are masked to SpellFamilyFlags1 = 256, which is Victory
-- Rush alone (gen_sql.py classmask --family 4 --spells 34428).
--
-- ProcCharges = 1 on the buff is what consumes it.  A spell modifier aura with
-- charges is dropped by the engine when a cast matches it -- no proc row and no
-- script, the same mechanism Sword and Board uses.  Charges are actually
-- released in Spell::finish via RemoveSpellMods rather than at the moment the
-- first modifier is read, so the damage mod cannot consume the aura out from
-- under the heal mod on the same cast.
--
-- Attributes = 256 is set EXPLICITLY and must stay that way.  Base 32216 ships
-- with 384, which includes 0x80 SPELL_ATTR0_DO_NOT_DISPLAY -- Victorious is
-- only visible at all because woa_2026_08_07_03.sql overrode it to 256 when
-- Small Victories started granting it.  `gen_sql.py dbc --base` clones from the
-- BASE Spell.dbc and does not layer alonecraft_spell_dbc on top, so without
-- this line the clone inherits the hidden flag and Safeguard becomes a buff the
-- player cannot see -- on a talent whose entire job is telling you that Victory
-- Rush is available.
--
-- Note core's spell_warr_victory_rush removes 32216 OnCast and knows nothing
-- about 200646.  That is fine and is why the charge matters: without it,
-- Safeguard would buff every Victory Rush for its full 20 seconds.
--
-- Per-rank chance lives in the DBC ProcChance (5 / 10) rather than in
-- spell_proc.Chance, so that the description's $h renders the right number --
-- there is no tooltip variable for a spell_proc column.  This is the Small
-- Victories pattern (woa_2026_08_07_03.sql).  spell_proc.Chance stays 0, which
-- means "fall back to the spell's own ProcChance".
--
-- The core spell_proc row for -46945 is DELETED rather than edited: it is a
-- negative (all-ranks) row, and two positive per-rank rows cannot coexist with
-- it -- LoadSpellProcs would log a duplicate and keep only one.  Both ranks now
-- get their own row purely so this stays readable; the chance is in the DBC
-- either way.
--
--   HitMask 8256 = 0x40 PROC_HIT_BLOCK | 0x2000 PROC_HIT_FULL_BLOCK
--   ProcFlags 40 = 0x8 TAKEN_MELEE_AUTO_ATTACK | 0x20 TAKEN_SPELL_MELEE_DMG_CLASS
--   SpellPhaseMask 2 is mandatory for the 0x20 half (SpellMgr.cpp:2112).
--
-- Spells:
--   46945 / 46949 = Safeguard ranks 1-2
--   200646        = Safeguard buff (new)
--   32216         = Victorious (untouched, still the Small Victories payout)
-- ============================================================

